Package: ems-simulate
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Chen Dongyu <1755696012@qq.com>
Description: EMS Simulate - Energy Management System Simulator
 A simulation software for EMS devices including PCS, BMS, and Meters.
 Supports Modbus TCP/RTU, IEC 104, IEC 61850 (GOOSE/Reports/SCL), and DL/T645 protocols.
